  "bio": "Emin Rob Pascal is a highly skilled tattoo artist from Duisburg, Germany, who specializes in black and gray realism. Renowned for their meticulous attention to detail and mastery of shading, Emin's work stands out for its lifelike quality and artistic depth. Clients can expect a truly professional experience from consultation to the finished piece, underlined by the artist's commitment to maintaining a clean and hygienic workspace.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Duisburg, North-rhine-westphalia, Germany\n\n• Sprechzeiten Mo-Fr 12-14Uhr\n• Preisanfragen nur im Studio                    \n•📍Dahlingstr. 91  47229 Duisburg",
